    "detailed_description": "Crimson Phoenix Rise is Metrovania Platfomer on PC that allows the player to choose the ending based upon their decisions in-game. Currently, I am seeking feedback on the game's mechanics and art style to further refine it, before releasing it in any official capacity. Please leave any constructive feedback in the comment section.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA functional grappling hook<br />\r\nAn inventory system<br />\r\nA global map<br />\r\nMelee Combat<br />\r\nShooting Combat<br />\r\nAnd abilities that allow you to dodge<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this game, you'll need to master the gameplay mechanics to make it out of high stake situations on Mars.",
    "about_the_game": "Crimson Phoenix Rise is Metrovania Platfomer on PC that allows the player to choose the ending based upon their decisions in-game. Currently, I am seeking feedback on the game's mechanics and art style to further refine it, before releasing it in any official capacity. Please leave any constructive feedback in the comment section.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nA functional grappling hook<br />\r\nAn inventory system<br />\r\nA global map<br />\r\nMelee Combat<br />\r\nShooting Combat<br />\r\nAnd abilities that allow you to dodge<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this game, you'll need to master the gameplay mechanics to make it out of high stake situations on Mars.",
    "short_description": "The game is a story-driven 2D platformer, with some Metroidvania aspects, where the player determines the outcome of the game based upon their \u201cMorality\u201d score, which itself is based upon the player's decision to kill in the game.",
